    {
      "text": "Full-page scan of a typewritten Russian-language page of World Health Assembly document A40/A/Conf.Paper No.7 Rev.2 (13 May 1987) on the global strategy for the prevention and control of AIDS; it shows the WHO letterhead, the title of the draft resolution prepared by the Drafting Group and the preambular paragraphs. The scan appears with inverted colours (white text on black).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
